 * panel round: `active-workout-evaluation`). No timeout at all was previously configured anywhere on
 * this shared client — a dropped connection or a stalled response on any PATCH left its caller's
 * coroutine parked forever, which for `ActiveWorkoutState`'s evaluation writes meant a claim in
 * [com.gymie.shared.ui.workout.PendingEvaluationQueue] that could never release, since the only thing
 * that ever releases it is the write's own `finally` block finishing.
