 * [ApiRequestSupport.mapException] maps each of the three timeout types this block can throw —
 * `ConnectTimeoutException` from `connectTimeoutMillis`, and `HttpRequestTimeoutException` and
 * `SocketTimeoutException` from `requestTimeoutMillis` and `socketTimeoutMillis` respectively —
 * to a friendly message, so none of the three ever surfaces raw Ktor internals to a user.
 */
private const val REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MILLIS = 15_000L
private const val CONNECT_TIMEOUT_MILLIS = 10_000L
private const val SOCKET_TIMEOUT_MILLIS = 15_000L

